ressed&lt;/a&gt; &amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp; &lt;a href='https://redirect-service-73lh.onrender.com/signal?item=Qev7iWI-2Nk&amp;signal=2&amp;source=The%20Rest%20Is%20History&amp;type=youtube&amp;context=pretty_positive&amp;dest=https%3A//maxmrry.github.io/curious-rabbit-hole-bot/&amp;token=9412ce3ed98e5434694fdbb1057a07ce58d5928e92b5cb466c9677cb0e6bd128' style='text-decoration:none;'&gt;💪 Pretty Positive. Kinda Cool.&lt;/a&gt; &amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp; &lt;a href='https://redirect-service-73lh.onrender.com/signal?item=Qev7iWI-2Nk&amp;signal=0&amp;source=The%20Rest%20Is%20History&amp;type=youtube&amp;context=not_interested&amp;dest=https%3A//maxmrry.github.io/curious-rabbit-hole-bot/&amp;token=9412ce3ed98e5434694fdbb1057a07ce58d5928e92b5cb466c9677cb0e6bd128' style='text-decoration:none;'&gt;🥱 Don't Care... Not Interested&lt;/a&gt; &amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp; &lt;a href='https://redirect-service-73lh.onrender.com/signal?item=Qev7iWI-2Nk&amp;signal=-1&amp;source=The%20Rest%20Is%20History&amp;type=youtube&amp;context=too_gloomy&amp;dest=https%3A//maxmrry.github.io/curious-rabbit-hole-bot/&amp;token=9412ce3ed98e5434694fdbb1057a07ce58d5928e92b5cb466c9677cb0e6bd128' style='text-decoration:none;'&gt;⛔ Too Gloomy / Negative&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">brain:Qev7iWI-2Nk</guid><enclosure url="https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Qev7iWI-2Nk/hqdefault.jpg" length="0" type="image/jpeg"/><pubDate>Sat, 16 May 2026 08:24:10 +0100</pubDate></item><item><title>(Audio) WWF Podcast: Climate Change, Habitat Loss, and Endangered Species</title><link>https://feeds.libsyn.com/426134/rss</link><description>&lt;b&gt;Source:&lt;/b&gt; World Wildlife Fund&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src='https://static.libsyn.com/p/assets/b/a/1/e/ba1e4b9711f8f111a04421dee9605cbd/NatureBreaking-Logo_Square.jpg' alt='thumbnail' style='max-width:100%; border-radius:8px;'/&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This podcast features host Seth Larson interviewing experts on significant environmental issues such as climate chan